test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5136209Z     design              Choose and build a device from a typed electrical
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5136577Z                         goal.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5136900Z     prompt              Natural-language request -> intent, layout,
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5137290Z                         verification, simulation, report.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5137681Z     generate            Generate verified artifacts from a DSL file.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5138077Z     verify              Verify a DSL file (no export).
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5138460Z     epr                 Loss-participation (EPR) and coherence estimate for a
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5138887Z                         DSL file. EPR_ANALYTICAL_ONLY by default; never a
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5139223Z                         field solution.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5139571Z     evidence            Inspect and validate evidence ledgers (the source of
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5139949Z                         truth for every physics claim).
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5140315Z     doctor              Check the environment (imports, solvers, write perms).
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5140762Z     jobs                Start, inspect, collect, cancel, and resume persistent
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5141119Z                         local solver jobs.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5141403Z     serve               Run the FastAPI plugin server.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5141757Z     simulate            Run supported external solver benchmarks.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5142173Z     yield               JJ critical-current variability / fabrication-yield
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5142584Z                         Monte Carlo. Drawing one SQUID loop proves geometry,
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5142928Z                         not manufacturability.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5143291Z     chip                Multi-qubit chip-level frequency-collision analysis. A
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5143699Z                         single-device closed loop cannot answer whether a
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5144023Z                         processor works.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5144350Z     pdk                 Foundry PDK abstraction: list registered technologies
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5144747Z                         or inspect a PDK's full provenance and process
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5145056Z                         parameters.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5145400Z     measurement         Simulation-vs-measurement correlation: the path from
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5145803Z                         illustrative to fab-calibrated numbers.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5146593Z     kqcircuits-cpw      Generate verified straight CPW gap masks via an
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5146999Z                         isolated KQCircuits runtime; no EM simulation.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5150023Z     quantum-metal-mask  Generate independently checked charge-pad/ground
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5150554Z                         masks; no junction or EM simulation.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5150933Z     pyepr-circuit       Run an ideal one-mode circuit with
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5151326Z                         convergence/reference checks; no EM extraction.
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5151750Z     circuitq-lc         Run ideal LC with fixed grid/domain/reference checks;
test (windows-latest, 3.11)	UNKNOWN STEP	2026-10-11T14:50:03.5152113Z                         no EM extraction.
